- If product is pink/rose → soft sage or cool light grey matte surface
- If product is earth/brown tones → muted blue-grey or soft lavender matte surface
The surface should be UNIFORM, FLAT, and MATTE — no texture, no grain, no marble pattern. Just a clean pastel color.

CAMERA: Directly overhead, ~85-90°. Even diffused studio lighting. No harsh shadows.

ARRANGEMENT (organized in clean rows, top to bottom):
