`Premium e-commerce marketing infographic photograph for a bedding product.

PRODUCT DETAILS: ${sig}
SET CONTENTS: ${pieceInfo}

LAYOUT: The bedding product is centered on a perfectly made bed — impeccably ironed, flawlessly neat, symmetrically arranged. The bed is in a clean, bright, modern setting with MINIMAL background distraction. The product is the absolute hero.

CALLOUT BADGE SYSTEM — 5 premium Turkish text badges:
Create 5 small, elegant callout badges connected to different parts of the product by thin straight lines.

Badge positions (distributed evenly around the product):
- TOP-LEFT: Fabric type badge → thin line points to the fabric surface
